 update the editor when the project settings are changed (see #122846), but I realized that the `EditorNode::_update_from_settings()` function actually updates _every_ property watched. That includes 99% of properties that weren't changed.\r\n\r\nIt needs to be tested, but I think my refactor is thorough. It does check now if the property was changed before applying the results to the editor.\r\n\r\n(oh, and by the way, I took the opportunity to reorder the project settings by their name (path).\r\n\r\n### Performance test\r\nI tested my new property (a float I added in #122846) before and after the refactor, and here's the timing results for the function call.\r\n\r\n#### Before\r\n```\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 215µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 192µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 204µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 208µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 233µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 221µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 234µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 205µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 176µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 232µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 210µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 219µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 253µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 254µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 197µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 220µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 236µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 228µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 255µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 202µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 248µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 216µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 238µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 252µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 234µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 229µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 207µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 198µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 238µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 243µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 228µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 292µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 235µs\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### After\r\n```\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 53µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 52µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 42µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 40µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 77µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 61µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 46µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 43µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 43µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 50µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 42µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 42µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 42µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 44µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 42µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 66µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 45µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 42µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 43µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 51µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 46µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 52µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 43µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 43µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 48µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 45µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 42µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 56µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 42µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 92µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 56µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 58µs\r\nEditorNode::_update_from_settings() took 49µs\r\n``